      "Title": "Sales Assistant",
      "Company": "Phone Watch",
      "Location": "Mumbai, India",
      "Description": "Your daily duties will include processing sales, building a customer pipeline, arranging call backs with potential customers while being the face of the company.",
      "FullDescription": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Entry Level Sales – No Experience Required",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Start your sales career with ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "bold": {},
              "text": "Phonewatch",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ". The company with the lowest sales target in Ireland that comes with award-winning sales training.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Employment Type: Full Time Monday – Friday",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "bold": {},
              "text": "Who Are PhoneWatch?",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "We have over 30 years' experience keeping over 115,000 customers across Ireland safe. They rate us 4.8/5 stars for our customer service. With our own Alarm Receiving Centre, all-inclusive service, and state-of-the-art home alarm systems we offer immediate response to any type of alarm.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Are You Looking For:",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "format": "unordered",
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "list-item",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Flexible working hours",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list-item",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Fun work environment",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list-item",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "A clear progression path",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "list-item",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "Top performer trips to exotic destinations like Dubai, Mauritius, Rio De Janeiro, Thailand and more",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "This is the role for you!",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "What We Offer:",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Uncapped commission",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Weekly pay",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Award winning sales training",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Sociable working hours- weekends to ",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "url": "https://www.google.com",
              "type": "link",
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": "yourself",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "!",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Amazing opportunities to progress and upskill to 'Future Leaders' and possible promotions afterwards.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Frequent work parties in Ireland's most prestigious venues such as The Guinness Storehouse, The Mansion House and many more.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Sales Rep referral scheme",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The Ideal Candidate:",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "The ideal candidates should have a can-do attitude while working in a fast-paced environment and work well under pressure. Work well as part of a team and have a passion for sales and customer satisfaction.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "bold": {},
              "text": "About The Job:",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Your daily duties will include processing sales, building a customer pipeline, arranging call backs with potential customers while being the face of the company.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "OTE €33,000 – Based off commission structure, this is a field sales role.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Typically, Sales Representatives will earn between €26,000-€35,000 OTE in their first year, and top performers can earn up to €45,000 OTE. Working off a commission only basis, for just 4 sales per month (1 per week) you will receive a payment of €1,940. You will receive €285 for each sale you make after your first four sales.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "There is no limit to what the right person can earn.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Requirements: You must be 18 or over to apply for this role with a clean criminal record",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
