              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Your daily duties will include processing sales, building a customer pipeline, arranging call backs with potential customers while being the face of the company.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "OTE €33,000 – Based off commission structure, this is a field sales role.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Typically, Sales Representatives will earn between €26,000-€35,000 OTE in their first year, and top performers can earn up to €45,000 OTE. Working off a commission only basis, for just 4 sales per month (1 per week) you will receive a payment of €1,940. You will receive €285 for each sale you make after your first four sales.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "There is no limit to what the right person can earn.",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Requirements: You must be 18 or over to apply for this role with a clean criminal record",
                    "type": "text"
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "createdAt": "2025-02-27T22:44:58.664Z",
            "updatedAt": "2025-03-04T15:51:05.028Z",
            "publishedAt": "2025-03-04T15:51:05.263Z"
          }
        ]
